This project contains a clean Rust port of projection and indexing algorithms
from rhealpixdggs-py:

    https://github.com/manaakiwhenua/rhealpixdggs-py

The upstream implementation is available under the MIT License or LGPL-3.0.
This repository uses it under the MIT option. The original copyright notice is
preserved in LICENSE.

The New Zealand benchmark geometry in
`benchmarks/data/new-zealand.geojson` is provided by SimpleMaps:

    https://simplemaps.com/gis/country/nz

